<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Herdez started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Herdez started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns started coverage of Mexican food company Grupo Herdez SA with an attractive rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Mark Abramson said as Mexico's leading dry goods food producer, Herdez is a likely beneficiary of the turnaround in consumption. Moreover, the shares are extremely undervalued, he said.</p>
<p>-- He warned that because the share was extremely illiquid, the stock may not be for all accounts.</p>
<p>-- Herdez shares were unchanged on Friday at 2.90 pesos.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9565))</p>
</text>
